WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,670 --> 00:00:03,500
Miss Shen

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:04,910
We also want to install one downstairs.

3
00:00:04,910 --> 00:00:06,830
Fangdaomen, are there any of you who can help?

4
00:00:06,830 --> 00:00:08,750
We only have enough materials to install this one door.

5
00:00:08,750 --> 00:00:09,990
You are too selfish

6
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:12,350
You understand why the entrance door to the room is not installed below.

7
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,150
Just to prevent us neighbors from misunderstanding.

8
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:16,350
We just want the unit building

9
00:00:16,350 --> 00:00:17,350
Let’s make it safer together

10
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:18,470
There is strength in numbers

11
00:00:18,470 --> 00:00:19,910
Your house on the fifteenth floor is so strict

12
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,550
I brought back so many supplies today

13
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,070
I have to show everyone a way to survive.

14
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:26,280
What did I bring back?

15
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:27,840
Your girlfriend saw it clearly just now

16
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:29,080
I even want to share daily necessities

17
00:00:29,080 --> 00:00:30,240
Then go out and find it yourself

18
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,880
Don’t go up to the fifteenth floor to make decisions again.

19
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,240
Otherwise, you will know the consequences yourself.

20
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:35,990
Keep pushing others out to test

21
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:36,990
hide behind yourself

22
00:00:36,990 --> 00:00:39,770
The abacus is small.

23
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:43,900
Install another power grid

24
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,540
Take a look at this power grid on a cold road

25
00:00:45,540 --> 00:00:47,700
Can it be modified or upgraded? Yes.

26
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:50,180
If it's not safe to connect directly, I'll take it back and fix it.

27
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,740
I have to study Chinese medicine as soon as possible recently

28
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:54,460
You have to learn how to steam wine. Sister Shen has adjusted the power grid.

29
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:55,540
Already installed on the door of the room

30
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:57,260
Low-level can make people paralyzed, medium-level can make people dizzy.

31
00:00:57,260 --> 00:00:58,220
High-end can kill

32
00:00:58,220 --> 00:01:00,100
The remote control is hung on your door to shut down the door before going out.

33
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,460
Got it, thank you for your hard work

34
00:01:01,460 --> 00:01:03,860
I'm going to move the remaining supplies back now and I'll go with you.

35
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:04,860
It's too dangerous to be alone
